hadiths[8]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1322","Saeed bin Abi Maryam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad bin Jafar ne humein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Zaid bin Aslam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kiya, unhon ne Umar bin Khattab se riwayat kiya, unhon ne kaha: Tumhari muhabbat hadd se barhi hui beqarari na ho aur tumhara bughz tabahi na ho, pas maine kaha: Ye kis tarah hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab tum muhabbat karte ho to bachche ki tarah hadd se barh kar muhabbat me mubtala ho jate ho aur jab tum bughz rakhte ho to apne sathi ke liye tabahi chahte ho."
"1323","Hazrat Abu Huraira raziyallahu anhu se riwayat hai, unhon ne farmaya: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Pehlwan kushti lad kar gira dene wala nahi hai, beshak asal pehlwan wo hai jo ghusse ke waqt apne nafs par qaboo rakhta hai."
"1324","Hazrat Ibn Umar raziyallahu anhuma se riwayat hai, unhon ne farmaya: Insan jo mashroob peeta hai us me Allah ke nazdeek ajr ke etebar se us mashroob se bada koi mashroob nahi jo insan Allah ki raza hasil karne ke liye peeta hai."
"1325","Hazrat Sulaiman bin Surad raziyallahu anhu se riwayat hai, unhon ne farmaya: Do admi Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke samne ek dusre ko bura bhala kehne lage pas un me se ek surkh hone laga yahan tak ke us ka chehra surkh ho gaya, pas Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Beshak main ek kalima janta hun agar wo use kahe to us ka ghussa jata rahe, Auzu billahi minash shaitanir rajim, pas ek admi khara hua aur us ke paas aaya pas us ne kaha: Kya tum jante ho Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne kya farmaya hai, us ne kaha: Kaho Auzu billahi minash shaitanir rajim, pas us ne kaha: Kya tum mujhe deewana samajhte ho."
"1326","Sulaiman bin Surad raziyallahu anhu se riwayat hai, unhon ne farmaya: Main Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke paas baitha hua tha aur do admi ek dusre ko bura bhala keh rahe the, pas un me se ek surkh ho gaya aur us ki gardan ki ragein phool gayin, pas Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Beshak main ek kalima janta hun agar wo use kahe to us ka ghussa jata rahe, pas logon ne us se kaha: Beshak Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya hai: Shaitan mardood se Allah ki panah mango, pas us ne kaha: Kya main deewana hun."
"1327","Ibn Abbas raziyallahu anhuma se riwayat hai, unhon ne farmaya: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Logon ko deen sikhao aur aasani karo, sikhao aur aasani karo, teen martaba, aur farmaya: Aur jab tumhe ghussa aaye to khamosh raho, do martaba."
"1328","Ubaid Kindi rahimahullah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Maine Ali raziyallahu anhu ko Ibn al Kawwa se kehte hue suna: Kya tum jante ho pehle logon ne kya kaha tha, unhon ne kaha: Jab tum kisi se muhabbat karo to us ki muhabbat me hadd se na barho pas ho sakta hai wo ek din tumhara dushman ban jaye, aur jab tum kisi se bughz rakho to us ke bughz me hadd se na barho pas ho sakta hai wo ek din tumhara dost ban jaye."
"1329","Umar bin Khattab raziyallahu anhu se riwayat hai, unhon ne farmaya: Tumhari muhabbat tumhe deewana na banaye aur tumhara bughz tumhe halak na kare, maine kaha: Aur ye kis tarah hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab tum muhabbat karo to bachche ki muhabbat ki tarah muhabbat karo jo deewangi se har cheez ko apne liye dekhta hai, aur jab tum bughz rakho to chaho ke tumhara mabghooz halak ho jaye."
